# Jem Lightfoote, Sky Explorer: the intervening "if" is checked again as the ability resolves (CR 603.4; ruling 2024-04-12).
# At Bot1's turn 3 end step no spell has been cast from hand, so the trigger goes on the stack; Bot1 then casts Death Ward
# on Jem from hand in response and the trigger does nothing when it resolves: hand Mountain, Island = 2 (the neighbouring
# scenario, with no response, draws to 3).

